  [PASS] the binary floor is NOT negligible against the virial signal -- it is comparable to or larger than the dispersion of a typical open cluster, which is reported as the reason this rung is limited  [CAN FAIL]   (sigma_bin = 0.548 km/s vs a typical virial sigma of 0.2-0.6 km/s)

